{"results":[{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CFjSxOdj8pk/","final_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CFjSxOdj8pk/","title":"PIB Fact Check on Instagram: \"Claim: Kins of those who died of COVID-19 can claim insurance under Pradhan Mantri Jeevan Jyoti Bima Yojana (PMJJBY) and Pradhan Mantri Suraksha Bima Yojana (PMSBY).\n\n#PIBFactCheck: PMSBY doesn't cover COVID-19 related deaths. It only provides insurance cover for death or permanent total disability due to accidents. \nWhereas, the benefits under PMJJBY can be claimed for COVID-19 related deaths.\"","description":"Claim: Kins of those who died of COVID-19 can claim insurance under Pradhan Mantri Jeevan Jyoti Bima Yojana (PMJJBY) and Pradhan Mantri Suraksha Bima Yojana (PMSBY).\n\n#PIBFactCheck: PMSBY doesn't cover COVID-19 related deaths. It only provides insurance cover for death or permanent total disability due to accidents. \nWhereas, the benefits under PMJJBY can be claimed for COVID-19 related deaths. - @pibfactcheck on September 25, 2020","language":"en","text":"Never miss a post from pibfactcheck\n\nSign up for Instagram to stay in the loop.\n\nSign up\n\nLog in\n\npibfactcheck\n\n•\n\nFollow\n\n---\n\npibfactcheck\n\n 318w\n\nClaim: Kins of those who died of COVID-19 can claim insurance under Pradhan Mantri Jeevan Jyoti Bima Yojana (PMJJBY) and Pradhan Mantri Suraksha Bima Yojana (PMSBY).  \n  \n#PIBFactCheck: PMSBY doesn't cover COVID-19 related deaths. It only provides insurance cover for death or permanent total disability due to accidents.   \nWhereas, the benefits under PMJJBY can be claimed for COVID-19 related deaths.\n\n## No comments yet.\n\nStart the conversation.\n\n197\n\nSeptember 25, 2020\n\nLog in to like or comment.\n\n---\n\nMore posts from pibfactcheck\n\nSee more posts\n\n---","author":null,"published_date":"2020-09-25T07:39:53.000Z","latency_ms":6171.616616999998,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}